	<section_number>3.2-6201</section_number>
	<catch_line>Horse racing excluded</catch_line>
	<text>
		The provisions of this chapter shall not apply to horse racing, as that term is defined by § 59.1-365.
	</text>
	<history>1991, c. 358, § 3.1-796.131; 2008, c. 860.</history>
